Excitement	A heightened emotional state of anticipation and positive energy toward something upcoming.	Enthusiasm, eagerness, thrill	Boredom, indifference, apathy	Restlessness, over-talking	We were so excited for this trip and the property delivered completely.	Safety	Fear of missing out	Motivation, joy of anticipation	Mild interest or buzz	Visible energy and anticipation	Uncontrollable enthusiasm or hyperactivity	
