Fear	An emotional response to perceived danger or threat, triggering alertness and self‚Äëprotection.	Anxiety, alarm, dread	Safety, calm, security	Hypervigilance, avoidance, control	I genuinely felt unsafe in my room that night.	Safety	Perceived danger, uncertainty	Self-protection, alertness	Unease or worry	Avoidance or hypervigilance	Panic or paralysis	
